From: Jan Vermaete <jan.vermaete@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] CMakeLists.txt: Drop obsolete Boost.System component

Boost.System is header-only in current Boost releases and no longer provides
a separate CMake package configuration. Do not request it as a component.

Upstream-Status: Pending

---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 5db0f14..f2b40e8 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -10 +10 @@
-find_package(Boost REQUIRED COMPONENTS regex system thread)
+find_package(Boost REQUIRED COMPONENTS regex thread)
